s/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aacec74d/uploads/origins/99a3daf4-0619-4e23-82cf-d6fd15939ad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e3325c7808e5948b2dc1e41ebfad7ae", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aacec74d/uploads/origins/99a3daf4-0619-4e23-82cf-d6fd15939ad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e3325c7808e5948b2dc1e41ebfad7ae, https://si.imgix.net/aacec74d/uploads/origins/99a3daf4-0619-4e23-82cf-d6fd15939ad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3f347b493b417e17daa6db7b0ca1c93 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aacec74d/uploads/origins/99a3daf4-0619-4e23-82cf-d6fd15939ad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ed3e860e1c6a9d69ae9dffb960c0c72 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちわ、あずまと申します。\nプログラミング垢です。\n\nYouTube、Twitter、AtCoder、Kaggle等のアイコンやサムネイルに使用したいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BxemdzkfMSoPF71T0ulgqGsX88QE4OG1?usp=sharing\n資料のキャラクター、衣装、構図やポーズはお任せでお願いします。\nご検討の程、よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1BxemdzkfMSoPF71T0ulgqGsX88QE4OG1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Greenhappy000/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e57dceac/uploads/origins/f9b8e12d-f322-446b-b87a-dadbc307b95a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a88831d8ea2932e8ff48e6a10df2d566", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e57dceac/uploads/origins/f9b8e12d-f322-446b-b87a-dadbc307b95a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a88831d8ea2932e8ff48e6a10df2d566, https://si.imgix.net/e57dceac/uploads/origins/f9b8e12d-f322-446b-b87a-dadbc307b95a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6cbb09c1358b153c8a86184ba38067dc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e57dceac/uploads/origins/f9b8e12d-f322-446b-b87a-dadbc307b95a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=cro